{"id":"book.aesop-north-wind-sun","version":"554ba92b63e7b1ecfc6b37888b4db3fbbb2e989b3ad53038696b1aa677bc5c4d","title":{"uz":"Shimoliy shamol va quyosh","ru":"Северный ветер и солнце","en":"The North Wind and the Sun"},"level":"A2","license":"public-domain","source":"Aesop's Fables, translated by George Fyler Townsend (1867), public domain; A2 retelling by the refl author","chapters":[{"id":"chapter.aesop-north-wind-sun.1","title":{"uz":"Shimoliy shamol va quyosh","ru":"Северный ветер и солнце","en":"The North Wind and the Sun"},"paragraphs":[{"id":"para.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1","sentences":[{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.1","text":"The North Wind and the Sun had an argument.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.1.1","text":"The","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.1.2","text":"North","lemma":"north","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.1.3","text":"Wind","lemma":"wind","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.1.4","text":"and","lemma":"and","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.1.5","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.1.6","text":"Sun","lemma":"sun","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.1.7","text":"had","lemma":"had","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.1.8","text":"an","lemma":"an","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.1.9","text":"argument","lemma":"argument","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.2","text":"Each one said that he was the strongest.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.2.1","text":"Each","lemma":"each","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.2.2","text":"one","lemma":"one","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.2.3","text":"said","lemma":"said","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.2.4","text":"that","lemma":"that","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.2.5","text":"he","lemma":"he","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.2.6","text":"was","lemma":"was","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.2.7","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.2.8","text":"strongest","lemma":"strongest","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3","text":"They agreed to test their power on a traveller who was walking home.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.1","text":"They","lemma":"they","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.2","text":"agreed","lemma":"agreed","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.3","text":"to","lemma":"to","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.4","text":"test","lemma":"test","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.5","text":"their","lemma":"their","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.6","text":"power","lemma":"power","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.7","text":"on","lemma":"on","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.8","text":"a","lemma":"a","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.9","text":"traveller","lemma":"traveller","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.10","text":"who","lemma":"who","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.11","text":"was","lemma":"was","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.12","text":"walking","lemma":"walking","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.1.3.13","text":"home","lemma":"home","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]}]},{"id":"para.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2","sentences":[{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1","text":"\"Whoever can make the traveller take off his coat is the winner,\" said the Sun.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.1","text":"Whoever","lemma":"whoever","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.2","text":"can","lemma":"can","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.3","text":"make","lemma":"make","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.4","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.5","text":"traveller","lemma":"traveller","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.6","text":"take","lemma":"take","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.7","text":"off","lemma":"off","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.8","text":"his","lemma":"his","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.9","text":"coat","lemma":"coat","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.10","text":"is","lemma":"is","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.11","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.12","text":"winner","lemma":"winner","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.13","text":"said","lemma":"said","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.14","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.2.1.15","text":"Sun","lemma":"sun","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]}]},{"id":"para.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3","sentences":[{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.1","text":"The North Wind went first.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.1.1","text":"The","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.1.2","text":"North","lemma":"north","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.1.3","text":"Wind","lemma":"wind","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.1.4","text":"went","lemma":"went","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.1.5","text":"first","lemma":"first","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.2","text":"He blew with all his might.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.2.1","text":"He","lemma":"he","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.2.2","text":"blew","lemma":"blew","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.2.3","text":"with","lemma":"with","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.2.4","text":"all","lemma":"all","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.2.5","text":"his","lemma":"his","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.2.6","text":"might","lemma":"might","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.3","text":"The sky grew dark, and the trees moved.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.3.1","text":"The","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.3.2","text":"sky","lemma":"sky","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.3.3","text":"grew","lemma":"grew","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.3.4","text":"dark","lemma":"dark","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.3.5","text":"and","lemma":"and","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.3.6","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.3.7","text":"trees","lemma":"trees","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.3.8","text":"moved","lemma":"moved","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4","text":"But the harder the wind blew, the closer the traveller held his coat.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.1","text":"But","lemma":"but","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.2","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.3","text":"harder","lemma":"harder","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.4","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.5","text":"wind","lemma":"wind","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.6","text":"blew","lemma":"blew","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.7","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.8","text":"closer","lemma":"closer","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.9","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.10","text":"traveller","lemma":"traveller","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.11","text":"held","lemma":"held","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.12","text":"his","lemma":"his","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.4.13","text":"coat","lemma":"coat","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5","text":"The man was cold, and he did not want to lose his only coat.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.1","text":"The","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.2","text":"man","lemma":"man","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.3","text":"was","lemma":"was","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.4","text":"cold","lemma":"cold","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.5","text":"and","lemma":"and","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.6","text":"he","lemma":"he","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.7","text":"did","lemma":"did","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.8","text":"not","lemma":"not","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.9","text":"want","lemma":"want","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.10","text":"to","lemma":"to","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.11","text":"lose","lemma":"lose","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.12","text":"his","lemma":"his","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.13","text":"only","lemma":"only","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.3.5.14","text":"coat","lemma":"coat","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]}]},{"id":"para.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4","sentences":[{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.1","text":"At last, the North Wind stopped.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.1.1","text":"At","lemma":"at","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.1.2","text":"last","lemma":"last","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.1.3","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.1.4","text":"North","lemma":"north","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.1.5","text":"Wind","lemma":"wind","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.1.6","text":"stopped","lemma":"stopped","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.2","text":"\"I cannot do it,\" he said.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.2.1","text":"I","lemma":"i","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.2.2","text":"cannot","lemma":"cannot","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.2.3","text":"do","lemma":"do","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.2.4","text":"it","lemma":"it","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.2.5","text":"he","lemma":"he","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.4.2.6","text":"said","lemma":"said","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]}]},{"id":"para.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5","sentences":[{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.1","text":"Then the Sun came out from behind a cloud.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.1.1","text":"Then","lemma":"then","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.1.2","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.1.3","text":"Sun","lemma":"sun","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.1.4","text":"came","lemma":"came","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.1.5","text":"out","lemma":"out","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.1.6","text":"from","lemma":"from","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.1.7","text":"behind","lemma":"behind","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.1.8","text":"a","lemma":"a","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.1.9","text":"cloud","lemma":"cloud","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.2","text":"He shone warmly on the road.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.2.1","text":"He","lemma":"he","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.2.2","text":"shone","lemma":"shone","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.2.3","text":"warmly","lemma":"warmly","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.2.4","text":"on","lemma":"on","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.2.5","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.2.6","text":"road","lemma":"road","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3","text":"The traveller walked past a house and a field of yellow flowers.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.1","text":"The","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.2","text":"traveller","lemma":"traveller","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.3","text":"walked","lemma":"walked","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.4","text":"past","lemma":"past","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.5","text":"a","lemma":"a","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.6","text":"house","lemma":"house","lexeme_id":"en.lex.house.building","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":["en.gram.article.first-mention","en.gram.noun.countability"]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.7","text":"and","lemma":"and","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.8","text":"a","lemma":"a","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.9","text":"field","lemma":"field","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.10","text":"of","lemma":"of","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.11","text":"yellow","lemma":"yellow","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.3.12","text":"flowers","lemma":"flowers","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.4","text":"Soon he felt hot.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.4.1","text":"Soon","lemma":"soon","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.4.2","text":"he","lemma":"he","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.4.3","text":"felt","lemma":"felt","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.4.4","text":"hot","lemma":"hot","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5","text":"He took off his coat and carried it over his arm.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5.1","text":"He","lemma":"he","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5.2","text":"took","lemma":"took","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5.3","text":"off","lemma":"off","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5.4","text":"his","lemma":"his","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5.5","text":"coat","lemma":"coat","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5.6","text":"and","lemma":"and","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5.7","text":"carried","lemma":"carried","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5.8","text":"it","lemma":"it","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5.9","text":"over","lemma":"over","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5.10","text":"his","lemma":"his","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.5.11","text":"arm","lemma":"arm","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]}]},{"id":"sentence.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.6","text":"Then he sat near the water and drank from his hand.","tokens":[{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.6.1","text":"Then","lemma":"then","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.6.2","text":"he","lemma":"he","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.6.3","text":"sat","lemma":"sat","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.6.4","text":"near","lemma":"near","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.6.5","text":"the","lemma":"the","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":[]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.6.6","text":"water","lemma":"water","lexeme_id":"en.lex.water.liquid","sense_ids":[],"kc_ids":["en.gram.article.zero-general","en.gram.noun.countability"]},{"id":"token.aesop-north-wind-sun.1.5.6.7","text":"